"id: invalid option -- '%c'\\n\", ch)\n\t\t\tfmt.Fprintln(os.Stderr, \"Try 'id --help' for more information.\")\n\t\t\tos.Exit(1)\n\t\t}\n\t}\n}\n","numLines":151,"startLine":1,"totalLines":151}}}
